1
00:00:00,792 --> 00:00:05,797
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:11,428 --> 00:00:13,847
<i>I want you to cancel everything.</i>

3
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,348
<i>-Congressman…</i>
<i>-Shut up!</i>

4
00:00:15,432 --> 00:00:19,269
[chanting] <i>Take them down!</i>
<i>Bring down the Ardientes!</i>

5
00:00:19,352 --> 00:00:23,815
[Emilia] <i>Now then, tell me</i>
<i>everything there is to know</i>

6
00:00:23,898 --> 00:00:27,736
<i>about the woman we know as Ivy Aguas.</i>

7
00:00:27,819 --> 00:00:31,072
<i>-For a new Ardiente!</i>
<i>-For a new Ardiente!</i>

8
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:32,198
<i>No!</i>

9
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:35,410
<i>Make that bastard suffer!</i>

10
00:00:35,493 --> 00:00:38,455
<i>I want Diego Torillo's head!</i>

11
00:00:38,538 --> 00:00:42,625
<i>Who are you really? Are you Lily Cruz?!</i>

12
00:00:42,709 --> 00:00:44,127
<i>I am Lily Cruz!</i>

13
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:47,881
<i>Now that I'm here, I will</i>
<i>have you buried alive too!</i>

14
00:00:47,964 --> 00:00:51,593
[Julio] <i>You need to break up</i>
<i>with Ivy Aguas.</i>

15
00:00:51,676 --> 00:00:54,846
<i>Or else, you will lose this election.</i>

16
00:00:54,929 --> 00:00:57,807
<i>You forget that I'm an Ardiente!</i>
<i>I'm a predator.</i>

17
00:00:57,891 --> 00:01:00,769
<i>Or a kitten pretending to be a lion.</i>

18
00:01:00,852 --> 00:01:02,145
<i>Anna, go back home.</i>

19
00:01:02,228 --> 00:01:05,440
<i>I won't let them do to you</i>
<i>what they did to Nanny Carlotta.</i>

20
00:01:05,523 --> 00:01:07,817
<i>You're leaving, Anna.</i>

21
00:01:07,901 --> 00:01:09,819
-[screaming]
-<i>What's wrong with you?</i>

22
00:01:09,903 --> 00:01:11,780
<i>Lily Cruz is back!</i>

23
00:01:11,863 --> 00:01:15,200
<i>She's alive! With whom, Papa? Madrigal!</i>

24
00:01:15,283 --> 00:01:17,494
<i>I'm glad to see you again, Jepoy.</i>

25
00:01:17,577 --> 00:01:20,163
<i>I promised you I wouldn't leave</i>
<i>no matter what, didn't I?</i>

26
00:01:20,246 --> 00:01:22,082
<i>I need to stay alive to protect you.</i>

27
00:01:22,165 --> 00:01:25,960
<i>Ivy Aguas was adopted.</i>
<i>She must be the real Lily Cruz</i>

28
00:01:26,044 --> 00:01:27,837
<i>because she's been</i>
<i>hiding her real identity!</i>

29
00:01:27,921 --> 00:01:29,631
<i>When will you leave Ivy alone?</i>

30
00:01:29,714 --> 00:01:34,260
<i>The enemy is using</i>
<i>elementary tactics on us!</i>

31
00:01:34,344 --> 00:01:38,765
<i>Divide and conquer!</i>
<i>Blood is thicker than water!</i>

32
00:01:38,848 --> 00:01:40,975
[Ivy] <i>Nanny, you have visitors.</i>

33
00:01:41,059 --> 00:01:44,103
<i>Nanny, please help me convince them</i>

34
00:01:44,187 --> 00:01:48,149
<i>not to push through with their plans.</i>

35
00:01:53,738 --> 00:01:55,740
[sobbing]

36
00:01:59,828 --> 00:02:01,663
You don't have to carry it all.

37
00:02:04,124 --> 00:02:05,792
She was our family too.

38
00:02:08,086 --> 00:02:10,505
I know, Jepoy.

39
00:02:14,050 --> 00:02:16,010
And she always will be.

40
00:02:19,806 --> 00:02:21,766
I understand how you both feel,

41
00:02:22,767 --> 00:02:24,936
but please try to understand me too.

42
00:02:26,187 --> 00:02:27,605
I already made up my mind.

43
00:02:29,023 --> 00:02:32,443
You and Anna will go overseas
as soon as possible.

44
00:02:33,736 --> 00:02:36,990
Haven't you heard
anything we've said, Ivy?

45
00:02:37,532 --> 00:02:38,992
We're not leaving.

46
00:02:39,075 --> 00:02:40,618
Anna, this is my fight.

47
00:02:40,702 --> 00:02:43,705
You mean, <i>our</i> fight. We all want justice.

48
00:02:43,788 --> 00:02:45,623
This is our fight.

49
00:02:46,291 --> 00:02:49,294
Anna, please listen to me.

50
00:02:49,377 --> 00:02:51,629
Please stop being so stubborn.

51
00:02:51,713 --> 00:02:54,007
Ivy, you don't have to protect me.

52
00:02:54,090 --> 00:02:55,717
I can take care of myself.

53
00:02:56,342 --> 00:02:58,011
I learned from you, remember?

54
00:02:58,094 --> 00:03:00,763
You taught me how to fight for life.

55
00:03:05,018 --> 00:03:10,106
Aunt Carlotta let us experience
a mother's love,

56
00:03:10,189 --> 00:03:12,150
even though we were all orphans.

57
00:03:13,359 --> 00:03:15,862
Ivy, this fight isn't
yours alone. It's ours.

58
00:03:15,945 --> 00:03:18,698
Anna, listen to me.
Anything but this fight.

59
00:03:18,781 --> 00:03:21,826
I'd gladly ask for your help,
but not in this one.

60
00:03:22,869 --> 00:03:23,995
Want to know why?

61
00:03:25,663 --> 00:03:28,416
You don't understand
how hard it was for me…

62
00:03:29,751 --> 00:03:31,669
when Nanny Carlotta died.

63
00:03:32,045 --> 00:03:33,546
It was my fault.

64
00:03:34,589 --> 00:03:37,926
She died because of me.

65
00:03:38,384 --> 00:03:41,137
You lost someone dear to you
because of me.

66
00:03:43,598 --> 00:03:48,561
So, if you won't listen to me,
I might lose you two.

67
00:03:48,645 --> 00:03:51,314
I don't want that to happen
because I care about you, Anna.

68
00:03:51,397 --> 00:03:52,815
So, please listen to what I say.

69
00:03:52,899 --> 00:03:55,818
Ivy, you know how the Ardientes
tortured me before,

70
00:03:55,902 --> 00:03:57,779
and Anna saw the scars from it.

71
00:03:57,862 --> 00:03:59,739
We also hold a grudge
against the Ardientes.

72
00:03:59,822 --> 00:04:00,907
That's my point!

73
00:04:00,990 --> 00:04:02,659
Jepoy, that's what I'm trying to say.

74
00:04:03,284 --> 00:04:04,786
I can't even imagine--

75
00:04:04,869 --> 00:04:07,580
Knowing what you experienced,
how Anna saw the scars…

76
00:04:07,664 --> 00:04:09,249
And yet, here you are!

77
00:04:10,083 --> 00:04:11,751
You even brought Anna here.

78
00:04:11,834 --> 00:04:14,337
Do you want her to
experience the same fate?

79
00:04:14,420 --> 00:04:15,546
As much as possible,

80
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:19,467
I don't want anyone else
to make sacrifices for me.

81
00:04:19,550 --> 00:04:21,844
I don't want anyone
to get involved in this.

82
00:04:22,595 --> 00:04:24,013
I can't bear it anymore!

83
00:04:24,973 --> 00:04:26,724
My conscience can no longer take it.

84
00:04:26,808 --> 00:04:29,727
So many people have been killed and hurt.

85
00:04:29,811 --> 00:04:32,063
Now you want to involve Anna too?

86
00:04:34,482 --> 00:04:38,820
So you two will listen to me.

87
00:04:41,281 --> 00:04:45,910
I won't deny the justice you're
seeking for Nanny Carlotta.

88
00:04:46,786 --> 00:04:47,996
You mean so much to me,

89
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:51,666
so you have to leave as soon as possible.

90
00:04:52,125 --> 00:04:57,130
[tense music playing]

91
00:05:04,679 --> 00:05:07,557
[Julio] <i>You need to break up</i>
<i>with Ivy Aguas.</i>

92
00:05:08,099 --> 00:05:12,353
<i>Or else, you will lose this election.</i>

93
00:05:12,854 --> 00:05:15,148
<i>You forget that I'm an Ardiente!</i>

94
00:05:15,231 --> 00:05:17,900
<i>I may love Ivy,</i>
<i>but I never forget who I am.</i>

95
00:05:18,609 --> 00:05:19,610
<i>I'm a predator.</i>

96
00:05:19,694 --> 00:05:21,321
<i>A predator?</i>

97
00:05:22,447 --> 00:05:25,742
<i>Or a kitten pretending to be a lion?</i>

98
00:05:34,542 --> 00:05:37,378
<i>I found out from my private investigator</i>

99
00:05:37,462 --> 00:05:39,547
<i>that Ivy Aguas was adopted.</i>

100
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:41,716
<i>So, she must be the real Lily Cruz</i>

101
00:05:41,799 --> 00:05:43,509
<i>because she's been</i>
<i>hiding her real identity!</i>

102
00:05:43,593 --> 00:05:45,928
<i>When will you leave Ivy alone?</i>

103
00:05:46,012 --> 00:05:47,388
<i>No, Arnaldo.</i>

104
00:05:48,056 --> 00:05:52,185
<i>I will never let her become an Ardiente.</i>

105
00:05:52,268 --> 00:05:56,814
<i>Because she has so many secrets,</i>
<i>and, until I uncover them all,</i>

106
00:05:56,898 --> 00:05:59,108
<i>I won't leave that woman alone!</i>

107
00:06:01,944 --> 00:06:04,697
HON, WHERE ARE YOU? I NEED YOU.
ANSWER THE PHONE.

108
00:06:06,699 --> 00:06:09,702
WHERE ARE YOU? I'LL FIND YOU
WHEREVER THE HELL YOU ARE!

109
00:06:16,292 --> 00:06:18,544
We're not leaving, Ivy.

110
00:06:19,212 --> 00:06:20,838
We won't leave you!

111
00:06:22,465 --> 00:06:26,219
[tense music playing]

112
00:06:26,302 --> 00:06:27,637
[phone chimes]

113
00:06:30,264 --> 00:06:32,266
WHERE ARE YOU? I'LL FIND YOU
WHEREVER THE HELL YOU ARE!

114
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,815
You're so stubborn.

115
00:06:38,898 --> 00:06:40,358
I need to go.

116
00:06:40,942 --> 00:06:43,861
-Ivy, wait! Where--
-Do you know what you did?

117
00:06:43,945 --> 00:06:46,447
Now that you revealed Anna as Lily Cruz,

118
00:06:46,531 --> 00:06:48,783
I need to rush the wedding!

119
00:06:50,159 --> 00:06:51,119
Let's go.

120
00:06:51,202 --> 00:06:56,207
[ominous music playing]

121
00:07:00,628 --> 00:07:01,712
Hon?

122
00:07:04,507 --> 00:07:05,633
Where have you been?

123
00:07:06,968 --> 00:07:10,179
We were together at the plaza
earlier, but you disappeared.

124
00:07:10,263 --> 00:07:14,684
Yes, didn't your mom tell you
that we were together?

125
00:07:15,435 --> 00:07:18,146
And Lily Cruz finally showed up.

126
00:07:18,229 --> 00:07:20,356
Lily Cruz, yes.

127
00:07:20,773 --> 00:07:22,316
I'm glad you mentioned that.

128
00:07:23,025 --> 00:07:25,069
I'm curious, what do you think about that?

129
00:07:26,737 --> 00:07:27,780
Shocked.

130
00:07:28,156 --> 00:07:31,576
But at the same time,
I can breathe easily now

131
00:07:31,659 --> 00:07:33,244
because your mom won't doubt me anymore.

132
00:07:33,327 --> 00:07:38,291
Your family will stop thinking
that I'm Lily Cruz.

133
00:07:39,041 --> 00:07:40,042
[scoffs]

134
00:07:41,294 --> 00:07:42,753
You know what's funny?

135
00:07:44,714 --> 00:07:50,553
Mom mentioned that, because you
didn't tell us you were adopted,

136
00:07:51,888 --> 00:07:58,394
there's a possibility
that you could be Lily Cruz.

137
00:08:05,776 --> 00:08:08,279
Hon, it's too personal for me.

138
00:08:10,490 --> 00:08:15,369
But, since I am your fiancée,
and we're going to be married…

139
00:08:19,707 --> 00:08:20,833
Yes, hon.

140
00:08:21,459 --> 00:08:22,710
I'm adopted.

141
00:08:26,506 --> 00:08:29,258
Prianka Aguas adopted me.

142
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:35,681
She fed me, clothed me,
and sent me to school.

143
00:08:37,475 --> 00:08:42,522
She took in a hopeless stray.

144
00:08:44,941 --> 00:08:46,484
Now, here I am.

145
00:08:48,861 --> 00:08:52,823
My name is Ivy Aguas, and I'm adopted.

146
00:08:56,494 --> 00:09:03,000
Well, I was surprised
you'd react that way.

147
00:09:03,084 --> 00:09:08,089
[unsettling music playing]

148
00:09:21,519 --> 00:09:26,357
I'm just happy. I know you better now.

149
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:31,445
[unsettling music playing]

150
00:09:44,417 --> 00:09:48,129
"Diego Torillo:
Savior of Poblacion Ardiente!"

151
00:09:48,754 --> 00:09:49,755
Batch!

152
00:09:50,131 --> 00:09:52,508
You're featured on a national broadsheet!

153
00:09:53,593 --> 00:09:55,136
It really pays to be inspired!

154
00:09:55,886 --> 00:09:57,763
Thanks again for all your help.

155
00:09:57,847 --> 00:09:58,973
Don't mention it.

156
00:09:59,682 --> 00:10:01,267
Batch, let me ask you.

157
00:10:02,226 --> 00:10:05,313
Aside from running for office,

158
00:10:05,730 --> 00:10:07,690
is there something else that inspires you?

159
00:10:08,232 --> 00:10:09,233
[scoffs]

160
00:10:11,569 --> 00:10:12,862
[chuckles]

161
00:10:12,945 --> 00:10:14,739
There is, isn't there?

162
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:17,783
Is it long-distance?
I haven't seen you with anyone.

163
00:10:18,868 --> 00:10:22,079
Or, are you still hung up on Lily Cruz?

164
00:10:22,913 --> 00:10:24,999
You've been crazy about her since college!

165
00:10:26,125 --> 00:10:27,293
So, it's still her?

166
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:32,923
Or, has Ivy Aguas taken her place?

167
00:10:33,633 --> 00:10:34,925
Don't be silly.

168
00:10:35,009 --> 00:10:37,595
We have things to do. Let's go. Come on!

169
00:10:39,722 --> 00:10:42,642
Well, Arnaldo, congratulations!

170
00:10:42,725 --> 00:10:44,810
You finally made it to the front page.

171
00:10:45,728 --> 00:10:50,191
Your disgrace is now a national joke!

172
00:10:54,695 --> 00:10:56,614
Any ideas how we can get out of it?

173
00:10:58,532 --> 00:10:59,867
No idea.

174
00:10:59,950 --> 00:11:01,661
Like you said, I'm bound to lose.

175
00:11:01,744 --> 00:11:03,037
So, why even try?

176
00:11:03,371 --> 00:11:04,413
Hon.

177
00:11:04,497 --> 00:11:05,706
[Julio] Emilia…

178
00:11:06,165 --> 00:11:10,044
Do you have any brilliant ideas?

179
00:11:12,004 --> 00:11:13,547
Honestly, Papa,

180
00:11:13,631 --> 00:11:17,343
there's nothing I can do to
help your exceptional grandson.

181
00:11:17,426 --> 00:11:18,761
[Julio chuckles]

182
00:11:19,804 --> 00:11:22,932
Well, the only thing
I can think of right now, Papa, is…

183
00:11:23,849 --> 00:11:30,398
I really believe that Lily Cruz
is financing Diego's campaign.

184
00:11:30,481 --> 00:11:32,775
They're using her money
to fund the campaign,

185
00:11:32,858 --> 00:11:35,694
and we have to cut them off.

186
00:11:36,737 --> 00:11:38,239
So, um…

187
00:11:39,031 --> 00:11:41,075
I'd like to take this opportunity

188
00:11:41,158 --> 00:11:44,245
to say sorry to you, Ivy.

189
00:11:44,787 --> 00:11:48,082
For thinking that you were
Lily Cruz all along.

190
00:11:49,333 --> 00:11:51,419
I sincerely apologize.

191
00:11:53,295 --> 00:11:55,089
Of course, Emilia.

192
00:11:55,172 --> 00:11:56,882
Apology accepted.

193
00:12:00,344 --> 00:12:02,847
Thank you. So, does that mean

194
00:12:02,930 --> 00:12:09,145
we can both join forces
to finally end Lily Cruz?

195
00:12:09,812 --> 00:12:14,567
[tense music playing]

196
00:12:24,535 --> 00:12:27,079
Gentlemen, I brought some refreshments.

197
00:12:27,163 --> 00:12:28,456
I'll put this over there.

198
00:12:28,539 --> 00:12:29,790
-Okay.
-Okay.

199
00:12:29,874 --> 00:12:31,542
-Let's take a break.
-All right.

200
00:12:35,504 --> 00:12:37,173
Nanny! Uncle!

201
00:12:41,969 --> 00:12:44,680
Nanny, what's wrong?

202
00:12:45,681 --> 00:12:48,267
Some people arrived from Manila.

203
00:12:49,268 --> 00:12:50,394
More enemies?

204
00:12:51,228 --> 00:12:53,063
What did the Ardientes do this time?

205
00:12:53,147 --> 00:12:55,441
No, it's not like that.

206
00:12:55,524 --> 00:12:59,778
They're suppliers for the "royal wedding."

207
00:13:00,404 --> 00:13:05,910
It seems like Arnaldo and Ivy
are rushing to get married.

208
00:13:05,993 --> 00:13:07,870
They're going to join forces.

209
00:13:08,621 --> 00:13:13,667
I don't get it. What's her agenda?

210
00:13:13,751 --> 00:13:15,753
What does Ivy Aguas want from us?

211
00:13:16,212 --> 00:13:21,217
[unsettling music playing]

212
00:13:28,265 --> 00:13:29,350
[knocking on door]

213
00:13:31,101 --> 00:13:33,479
Congressman, you have a visitor.

214
00:13:34,563 --> 00:13:35,523
Thank you.

215
00:13:35,606 --> 00:13:38,442
-Hi, Congressman.
-Come in, Doctor!

216
00:13:41,737 --> 00:13:42,905
Well…

217
00:13:44,740 --> 00:13:47,201
If you came all the way here

218
00:13:47,284 --> 00:13:50,371
to tell me the results of my biopsy…

219
00:13:51,789 --> 00:13:54,833
you must be the bearer of bad news.

220
00:13:54,917 --> 00:13:56,710
Julio, I'm sorry,

221
00:13:57,711 --> 00:13:59,421
but your cancer is back.

222
00:13:59,505 --> 00:14:02,967
[dramatic music playing]

223
00:14:03,050 --> 00:14:04,218
[sighs]

224
00:14:04,301 --> 00:14:06,929
I did tell you before that
there was a chance

225
00:14:07,012 --> 00:14:08,806
for your cancer to recur.

226
00:14:09,682 --> 00:14:13,143
Even after your remission back in the U.S.

227
00:14:14,103 --> 00:14:15,729
But with your recent accident…

228
00:14:17,106 --> 00:14:22,069
We all know that bone cancer
is very dangerous.

229
00:14:23,153 --> 00:14:24,280
Doc.

230
00:14:26,657 --> 00:14:28,742
Are you saying my days are numbered?

231
00:14:30,619 --> 00:14:34,164
Are we talking years?

232
00:14:36,292 --> 00:14:37,418
Months?

233
00:14:39,628 --> 00:14:40,754
Weeks?

234
00:14:44,633 --> 00:14:47,261
Julio, we have to conduct more tests.

235
00:14:47,344 --> 00:14:48,512
Oh!

236
00:14:49,430 --> 00:14:50,681
Well, then…

237
00:14:52,141 --> 00:14:55,936
I think it's best if we
postpone this talk.

238
00:14:57,313 --> 00:14:59,189
With the kind of news that you have…

239
00:15:00,649 --> 00:15:04,153
I have a lot of things
to put into order in my life.

240
00:15:06,739 --> 00:15:07,948
Excuse me, then.

241
00:15:08,741 --> 00:15:09,909
Of course.

242
00:15:17,291 --> 00:15:18,500
Well…

243
00:15:20,044 --> 00:15:22,171
If I have to die…

244
00:15:24,673 --> 00:15:26,508
I need to make sure

245
00:15:26,592 --> 00:15:29,803
that the Ardientes will stay in power.

246
00:15:29,887 --> 00:15:32,264
Arnaldo's wedding has to push through.

247
00:15:34,350 --> 00:15:38,896
Because he will need Ivy Aguas.

248
00:15:43,776 --> 00:15:48,280
When Arnaldo and Ivy's wedding
pushes through,

249
00:15:48,364 --> 00:15:51,116
the Ardientes will become invincible.

250
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:55,579
They will gain more power and wealth,

251
00:15:56,413 --> 00:15:58,666
and they will continue

252
00:15:58,749 --> 00:16:03,045
to bring terror to this town.

253
00:16:04,755 --> 00:16:06,298
Trust me, Nanny.

254
00:16:06,966 --> 00:16:10,302
I will do everything
to stop their wedding.

255
00:16:18,102 --> 00:16:21,563
I still don't agree
with any of your plans.

256
00:16:21,647 --> 00:16:25,734
But since you're persistent,
this is what we'll do.

257
00:16:25,818 --> 00:16:27,236
On the day of my wedding,

258
00:16:27,319 --> 00:16:30,030
I want you gone from Poblacion Ardiente.

259
00:16:31,031 --> 00:16:32,741
Are you serious, Ivy?

260
00:16:33,242 --> 00:16:36,495
Why will you marry that monster?
He killed Aunt Carlotta!

261
00:16:36,578 --> 00:16:37,913
Anna.

262
00:16:37,997 --> 00:16:40,541
I know what I'm doing.

263
00:16:40,624 --> 00:16:42,584
That's my plan. It's one way for us

264
00:16:42,668 --> 00:16:45,337
to seek justice for Nanny Carlotta.

265
00:16:45,838 --> 00:16:48,215
So, you need to trust my plans.

266
00:16:50,467 --> 00:16:51,927
There will be no wedding, Ivy.

267
00:16:52,011 --> 00:16:55,305
I won't let you marry that murderer!

268
00:16:55,389 --> 00:16:57,182
If I have to sleep with the devil himself

269
00:16:57,266 --> 00:16:59,309
to avenge Nanny Carlotta, I will!

270
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:06,984
Don't try to stop my wedding
or any of my plans.

271
00:17:07,609 --> 00:17:08,819
Don't you dare.

272
00:17:09,820 --> 00:17:14,199
Like what I've been telling you,
you have to trust my plans.

273
00:17:40,559 --> 00:17:44,146
The last time I saw you
like this was when Mom lost.

274
00:17:46,607 --> 00:17:51,445
It only goes to show that
you're worried I'll lose too.

275
00:17:53,864 --> 00:17:54,990
Yes.

276
00:17:59,453 --> 00:18:01,288
Come on, Arnaldo.

277
00:18:02,206 --> 00:18:04,958
Don't give me that questioning look.

278
00:18:05,542 --> 00:18:08,253
Don't give me that surprised look.

279
00:18:08,587 --> 00:18:10,089
Because you know I'm right!

280
00:18:11,673 --> 00:18:15,677
You allowed your emotions

281
00:18:15,761 --> 00:18:19,264
to rule over that thick head of yours.

282
00:18:21,517 --> 00:18:22,935
Well, partly…

283
00:18:23,393 --> 00:18:26,688
Partly, I'm also to blame.
Partly, it is my fault!

284
00:18:27,189 --> 00:18:32,027
You know why? I've loved you too
much as my grandson.

285
00:18:32,945 --> 00:18:35,656
I allowed my emotions to rule me too.

286
00:18:38,742 --> 00:18:39,743
How--

287
00:18:40,828 --> 00:18:43,580
How dumb could I get?!

288
00:18:45,124 --> 00:18:48,752
You know what? I should've
given you a good beating

289
00:18:48,836 --> 00:18:50,838
every time you failed in the past.

290
00:18:50,921 --> 00:18:54,258
How could I forget? These are my rules!

291
00:18:56,093 --> 00:18:59,388
How could I forget that a tiger,

292
00:18:59,471 --> 00:19:02,141
no matter how ferocious,

293
00:19:03,142 --> 00:19:05,811
can turn into a tame kitten

294
00:19:05,894 --> 00:19:11,650
when you feed it with milk
instead of fresh meat,

295
00:19:11,733 --> 00:19:16,113
and when you take care of it too much?!

296
00:19:17,406 --> 00:19:19,158
That tiger turned into a kitten!

297
00:19:21,577 --> 00:19:22,661
[Arnaldo] Hey!

298
00:19:23,662 --> 00:19:25,080
I'm not weak.

299
00:19:25,164 --> 00:19:26,748
You're helpless!

300
00:19:27,624 --> 00:19:30,752
[emphatic] You are helpless!

301
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:34,089
You're like a dying puppy!

302
00:19:34,673 --> 00:19:37,885
You know what that looks like?

303
00:19:39,344 --> 00:19:41,597
The truth of the matter is,

304
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:44,766
-Diego is far better than you!
-Take back what you said!

305
00:19:45,225 --> 00:19:47,769
I said take it back! Take it back!

306
00:19:48,187 --> 00:19:50,689
[tense music playing]

307
00:19:50,772 --> 00:19:53,442
[laughs]

308
00:19:54,568 --> 00:19:56,403
[laughs]

309
00:19:57,738 --> 00:19:59,323
Look at yourself.

310
00:20:00,741 --> 00:20:02,993
You've become uncontrollable.

311
00:20:04,661 --> 00:20:07,998
The once calculating,

312
00:20:08,081 --> 00:20:14,213
intelligent, brave grandson
that I had is gone.

313
00:20:17,758 --> 00:20:21,929
What's left is a childish
and spoiled weakling.

314
00:20:23,347 --> 00:20:27,059
A sensitive little boy.

315
00:20:27,643 --> 00:20:28,560
[yells and smacks]

316
00:20:29,144 --> 00:20:31,521
Get your act together!

317
00:20:35,317 --> 00:20:37,736
Let it bleed! Bleed!

318
00:20:39,196 --> 00:20:42,449
Bleed and taste your blood!

319
00:20:43,325 --> 00:20:45,118
Because I'm telling you,

320
00:20:45,202 --> 00:20:48,080
you are going to bleed more
than you would want.

321
00:20:48,163 --> 00:20:50,999
You will bleed far worse

322
00:20:51,083 --> 00:20:54,503
if you're going to lead Ardiente.

323
00:20:55,504 --> 00:20:59,675
Arnaldo, Ardiente is yours for the taking!

324
00:21:01,093 --> 00:21:05,013
I will leave this family in your hands.

325
00:21:05,847 --> 00:21:08,725
Poblacion Ardiente is yours!

326
00:21:10,143 --> 00:21:12,354
But you will have to want it.

327
00:21:13,230 --> 00:21:15,482
You will have to crave it.

328
00:21:16,191 --> 00:21:20,696
You will have to fight tooth,
nail, and claw to own it!

329
00:21:21,238 --> 00:21:24,700
You have to love it!
Love it more than life itself!

330
00:21:24,992 --> 00:21:28,495
Love it more than Ivy Aguas!

331
00:21:29,913 --> 00:21:32,249
More than anything else!

332
00:21:34,293 --> 00:21:35,544
Do you understand?

333
00:21:37,421 --> 00:21:40,007
-Yes.
-Do you?! Do you understand?!

334
00:21:40,090 --> 00:21:41,216
Yes! Yes!

335
00:21:41,300 --> 00:21:43,677
-I can't hear you!
-Yes, I understand!

336
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:46,054
-What?!
-Yes, I understand! Yes!

337
00:21:46,138 --> 00:21:48,348
Yes, I understand! Yes!

338
00:21:48,432 --> 00:21:50,225
Now, let me ask you.

339
00:21:50,726 --> 00:21:55,856
If I made you choose between
Ardiente and Ivy Aguas,

340
00:21:55,939 --> 00:21:58,400
which will you choose?! Answer me!

341
00:21:58,483 --> 00:21:59,359
-Ardiente!
-Answer me!

342
00:21:59,443 --> 00:22:00,861
Ardiente!

343
00:22:01,278 --> 00:22:04,072
I will kill everyone even Ivy Aguas!

344
00:22:04,156 --> 00:22:06,658
When it comes to Poblacion Ardiente!

345
00:22:07,159 --> 00:22:12,205
There! There! That is the power!

346
00:22:12,289 --> 00:22:15,542
That is the look that I want from you!

347
00:22:16,418 --> 00:22:18,587
I want you to be mad! Mad!

348
00:22:18,962 --> 00:22:20,339
Mad for power!

349
00:22:21,757 --> 00:22:23,925
Not for stupid love!

350
00:22:24,343 --> 00:22:29,347
[dramatic music playing]

351
00:22:39,024 --> 00:22:41,902
We've managed to sway
60 percent of Ardiente.

352
00:22:41,985 --> 00:22:44,988
And our next target is this.

353
00:22:46,323 --> 00:22:47,657
Their bailiwick.

354
00:22:47,991 --> 00:22:51,578
I know it will be hard,
but I know we can do it.

355
00:22:52,871 --> 00:22:54,581
Of course, Batch! We can do this!

356
00:22:54,664 --> 00:22:56,750
Especially now that
more people believe in you.

357
00:22:56,833 --> 00:22:59,002
They want to support Team Diego!

358
00:22:59,628 --> 00:23:03,173
They believe in him because
he's handsome and brave!

359
00:23:03,256 --> 00:23:06,468
Oh, well! He got that from me!

360
00:23:06,551 --> 00:23:08,428
[laughing]

361
00:23:08,512 --> 00:23:10,847
-Am I right?
-Pandoy, you're just hungry!

362
00:23:10,931 --> 00:23:12,057
[laughing]

363
00:23:12,140 --> 00:23:14,184
Come on, let's eat! Aunt Camia, let's go.

364
00:23:14,267 --> 00:23:15,519
-Let's go!
-Yeah, Diego!

365
00:23:16,186 --> 00:23:17,604
[phone rings]

366
00:23:21,858 --> 00:23:22,818
Hello, Lily?

367
00:23:23,944 --> 00:23:27,322
Mom, we need to meet.
I need you and Diego.

368
00:23:27,405 --> 00:23:30,617
Are you all right? Did something happen?

369
00:23:30,700 --> 00:23:31,868
[Ivy] <i>I'm okay.</i>

370
00:23:31,952 --> 00:23:34,496
It's a long story.
I'll tell you when we meet.

371
00:23:34,579 --> 00:23:36,123
I'll text you the address.

372
00:23:36,206 --> 00:23:39,000
Okay. Diego and I
will be there right away.

373
00:23:39,084 --> 00:23:40,460
Thank you, Mom.

374
00:23:41,878 --> 00:23:44,631
Auntie, is there a problem?

375
00:23:46,550 --> 00:23:47,801
Diego, it's Lily.

376
00:23:48,260 --> 00:23:49,719
She said she needs to see us.

377
00:23:50,595 --> 00:23:52,472
We need to meet her now.

378
00:23:53,265 --> 00:23:54,224
Okay, Auntie.

379
00:23:54,724 --> 00:23:56,309
Nanny, Uncle we need to go.

380
00:23:56,393 --> 00:23:57,853
-Batch, you're in charge.
-Okay.

381
00:23:57,936 --> 00:23:59,938
-We really need to go.
-Help yourselves.

382
00:24:00,021 --> 00:24:01,314
-Bye, Nanny.
-[Marlon] Take care.

383
00:24:03,567 --> 00:24:05,443
How can I be so dumb?

384
00:24:08,697 --> 00:24:12,033
Grandpa, I-- I'm sorry.

385
00:24:12,117 --> 00:24:14,327
I'm sorry for everything I've done.

386
00:24:14,411 --> 00:24:16,037
No, no, no. That's okay.

387
00:24:17,414 --> 00:24:20,542
That's water under the bridge.

388
00:24:21,668 --> 00:24:23,086
Now, we start anew.

389
00:24:23,628 --> 00:24:28,383
Now, we become methodical and cunning.

390
00:24:29,301 --> 00:24:31,428
We will first remove all the obstacles.

391
00:24:31,511 --> 00:24:35,682
We will eliminate everything in your way.

392
00:24:37,559 --> 00:24:38,810
Okay, well…

393
00:24:40,812 --> 00:24:44,357
Does that mean my wedding's canceled?

394
00:24:44,441 --> 00:24:46,026
No, no, no, no, no!

395
00:24:46,109 --> 00:24:48,862
The wedding goes as planned!

396
00:24:49,863 --> 00:24:52,991
Arnaldo, once you've become the governor,

397
00:24:53,074 --> 00:24:55,327
you'll need a first lady.

398
00:24:55,744 --> 00:25:00,624
And Ivy Aguas fits that role to a tee.

399
00:25:01,791 --> 00:25:06,713
Now, I don't care if you
treat her like some goddess

400
00:25:06,796 --> 00:25:08,965
or a piece of garbage after the wedding.

401
00:25:09,883 --> 00:25:14,930
What's important is
for her money to become ours.

402
00:25:15,639 --> 00:25:16,890
[Julio sighs]

403
00:25:16,973 --> 00:25:18,058
Now…

404
00:25:18,642 --> 00:25:20,727
when this is all done…

405
00:25:22,437 --> 00:25:26,858
our next move is to
make sure of your victory.

406
00:25:28,735 --> 00:25:29,778
All right.

407
00:25:31,404 --> 00:25:34,032
Well, then… I'll take care of Diego.

408
00:25:34,115 --> 00:25:35,116
I'll kill them all.

409
00:25:35,200 --> 00:25:38,078
Diego, Camia Cruz, Lily Cruz, Madrigal.

410
00:25:38,161 --> 00:25:39,454
I'd gladly kill them all.

411
00:25:39,537 --> 00:25:42,123
-No, no, no. No, Arnaldo.
-There won't be anyone left--

412
00:25:42,791 --> 00:25:45,335
You leave the dirty jobs to me.

413
00:25:45,418 --> 00:25:47,796
I will handle this.

414
00:25:49,005 --> 00:25:52,008
I want you to focus on your campaign…

415
00:25:53,426 --> 00:25:56,054
and on your upcoming wedding.

416
00:25:56,471 --> 00:25:59,099
Rush everything. Rush the preparation.

417
00:25:59,182 --> 00:26:01,643
Push everything! Push them forward.

418
00:26:01,726 --> 00:26:05,939
Make them move to complete this wedding.

419
00:26:10,860 --> 00:26:13,905
I'd be mad to think that
it's just a coincidence

420
00:26:13,989 --> 00:26:17,659
that Lily Cruz was there
when I cornered Ivy Aguas!

421
00:26:18,827 --> 00:26:21,538
I don't believe that. They can't fool me.

422
00:26:23,123 --> 00:26:25,667
Don't complicate things, Emilia.

423
00:26:26,001 --> 00:26:29,879
You already made up with Ivy
in front of Julio and Arnaldo.

424
00:26:29,963 --> 00:26:32,716
Please don't make yourself
look stupid again.

425
00:26:34,467 --> 00:26:37,887
Auntie, I'm going to hunt down Lily Cruz.

426
00:26:38,138 --> 00:26:41,349
If I have to kidnap and torture her

427
00:26:41,433 --> 00:26:43,977
until she tells me the truth, I'll do it.

428
00:26:44,644 --> 00:26:47,147
And I know someone who can do that for me.

429
00:26:51,192 --> 00:26:54,362
[scoffs] Oh, please.
Leave me out of this mess.

430
00:26:54,446 --> 00:26:58,533
I don't want to become
involved in your dirty jobs.

431
00:26:58,616 --> 00:27:00,744
-Are you sure, Raul?
-Of course.

432
00:27:00,827 --> 00:27:05,415
What if I ask for Jaguar's help instead?

433
00:27:05,957 --> 00:27:08,710
You know he's crazy for me.

434
00:27:09,044 --> 00:27:11,212
He will do anything for me.

435
00:27:12,213 --> 00:27:14,632
[scoffs] What are you saying?

436
00:27:14,716 --> 00:27:16,801
Why are you talking about Jaguar?

437
00:27:16,885 --> 00:27:19,679
Are you trying to make me jealous?

438
00:27:21,973 --> 00:27:23,224
Come on, Emilia.

439
00:27:25,143 --> 00:27:27,937
If you're just trying to
make me jealous, it's fine.

440
00:27:28,438 --> 00:27:31,358
I just don't want to see you together.

441
00:27:32,108 --> 00:27:35,779
You wouldn't like to
see me jealous. All right?

442
00:27:43,495 --> 00:27:45,497
[giggles]

443
00:27:46,498 --> 00:27:49,959
It's such a good feeling
that you're being desired

444
00:27:50,043 --> 00:27:52,879
not just by one but two.

445
00:27:53,254 --> 00:27:54,589
[chuckles]

446
00:27:55,215 --> 00:27:56,508
Emilia…

447
00:27:57,092 --> 00:27:59,386
Grandpa, I promise.
I'll make the most out of this.

448
00:27:59,469 --> 00:28:00,970
[stammers] I swear.

449
00:28:03,181 --> 00:28:04,432
Thank you.

450
00:28:05,892 --> 00:28:08,686
Thank you, Arnaldo.

451
00:28:12,774 --> 00:28:13,983
You know…

452
00:28:17,070 --> 00:28:18,279
I am…

453
00:28:19,906 --> 00:28:22,742
I am getting old, Arnaldo.

454
00:28:25,537 --> 00:28:27,580
I can feel my candle…

455
00:28:29,958 --> 00:28:30,959
melting.

456
00:28:33,128 --> 00:28:36,714
I can sense the light
in my eyes growing dim.

457
00:28:39,509 --> 00:28:44,013
And the last thing I'd like
to see before I close my eyes…

458
00:28:46,266 --> 00:28:51,354
is you standing and lording it

459
00:28:51,438 --> 00:28:53,982
over Poblacion Ardiente…

460
00:28:56,025 --> 00:28:57,986
continuing my legacy.

461
00:29:02,282 --> 00:29:04,451
That is my dream.

462
00:29:13,126 --> 00:29:14,669
I-- I don't get it.

463
00:29:14,753 --> 00:29:17,213
Why are you talking like that, Grandpa?

464
00:29:17,297 --> 00:29:19,549
-[thud]
-Arnaldo, it is what it is!

465
00:29:20,300 --> 00:29:21,843
Everybody dies!

466
00:29:22,635 --> 00:29:26,347
The time will come that I will die.

467
00:29:28,808 --> 00:29:31,352
Remember once upon a time when I told you…

468
00:29:32,228 --> 00:29:34,522
that I will live forever?

469
00:29:36,733 --> 00:29:37,817
Arnaldo.

470
00:29:38,485 --> 00:29:40,737
You are my life!

471
00:29:41,905 --> 00:29:44,741
It is through you
that I will live forever!

472
00:29:46,117 --> 00:29:47,452
In my dream…

473
00:29:48,912 --> 00:29:52,707
you will be the king
of Poblacion Ardiente!

474
00:29:53,291 --> 00:29:57,670
And running in your veins
is the Ardiente blood.

475
00:29:58,004 --> 00:30:00,548
And it will be as if I am with you,

476
00:30:00,632 --> 00:30:02,050
that I'm standing there,

477
00:30:02,133 --> 00:30:03,843
and still leading you,

478
00:30:03,927 --> 00:30:08,014
and still ruling Poblacion Ardiente.

479
00:30:11,851 --> 00:30:14,646
Make my dream come true, Arnaldo.

480
00:30:16,231 --> 00:30:20,985
Make my dream come true before I fade.

481
00:30:21,069 --> 00:30:25,073
[emotional music playing]

482
00:30:34,249 --> 00:30:35,625
Viva Ardiente.

483
00:30:40,755 --> 00:30:43,758
[ominous music playing]

484
00:30:44,968 --> 00:30:46,886
Viva Ardiente!

485
00:30:53,101 --> 00:30:54,269
-Mom.
-Lily.

486
00:30:57,647 --> 00:30:59,983
-Diego.
-What happened to you?

487
00:31:00,316 --> 00:31:02,610
Nothing, Mom. I'm fine.

488
00:31:03,611 --> 00:31:07,490
But Emilia almost found out
my real identity.

489
00:31:07,574 --> 00:31:08,700
What?!

490
00:31:08,783 --> 00:31:10,368
It's a good thing you got out of it.

491
00:31:10,827 --> 00:31:12,203
Someone helped me.

492
00:31:12,620 --> 00:31:13,663
Who?

493
00:31:13,746 --> 00:31:14,831
[Jepoy] Me.

494
00:31:17,500 --> 00:31:19,419
Mom, they're the ones who helped me.

495
00:31:20,378 --> 00:31:21,671
This is Anna.

496
00:31:22,964 --> 00:31:24,883
She's our childhood friend.

497
00:31:26,217 --> 00:31:30,013
Anna was the one who pretended to be me.

498
00:31:35,768 --> 00:31:37,979
She pretended to be Lily Cruz.

499
00:31:38,062 --> 00:31:42,358
[dramatic music playing]

500
00:31:46,571 --> 00:31:48,781
Don't proceed, Emilia. Please!

501
00:31:48,865 --> 00:31:50,325
Stop the obsession.

502
00:31:50,408 --> 00:31:53,703
[scoffs] Auntie, did I just
hear you say stop?

503
00:31:54,078 --> 00:31:57,332
And you think that's part
of my vocabulary? "Stop"?

504
00:31:57,874 --> 00:32:00,668
What Emilia wants, Emilia gets.

505
00:32:01,169 --> 00:32:04,172
And I'm sure he can't resist me.

506
00:32:05,840 --> 00:32:10,845
[unsettling music playing]

507
00:32:13,765 --> 00:32:15,934
[phone rings]

508
00:32:31,157 --> 00:32:32,617
Hello, Jaguar.

509
00:32:33,034 --> 00:32:34,911
Did you miss me, sweetheart?

510
00:32:34,994 --> 00:32:36,496
<i>Because I missed you.</i>

511
00:32:36,579 --> 00:32:38,331
The scent of your neck,

512
00:32:38,414 --> 00:32:39,958
and the smooth touch of your hands.

513
00:32:41,167 --> 00:32:42,377
You taste so good.

514
00:32:42,627 --> 00:32:44,003
[giggling]

515
00:32:44,087 --> 00:32:47,423
Can you stop flirting
with me, Jaguar? Enough.

516
00:32:48,091 --> 00:32:50,718
<i>I want you to do something for me.</i>

517
00:32:52,220 --> 00:32:54,430
I have a job for you.

518
00:32:54,847 --> 00:32:57,684
It's my enemy, Lily Cruz.

519
00:32:58,393 --> 00:33:00,728
[Jaguar] <i>I'm not your servant, Emilia.</i>

520
00:33:02,146 --> 00:33:04,816
Yes, but you need something from me.

521
00:33:04,899 --> 00:33:07,276
You want me to join you.

522
00:33:07,360 --> 00:33:10,947
So, if you do this, I'll be yours.

523
00:33:11,030 --> 00:33:12,490
[chuckles]

524
00:33:13,282 --> 00:33:17,245
Even if you don't choose me,
Emilia, it won't matter.

525
00:33:19,330 --> 00:33:20,456
First of all,

526
00:33:20,540 --> 00:33:23,626
your family, the Ardientes,
is about to go down.

527
00:33:25,003 --> 00:33:27,630
That's why I'm better off
siding with Diego Torillo.

528
00:33:28,881 --> 00:33:33,177
But because I like you,

529
00:33:33,970 --> 00:33:35,847
<i>I'll give you another chance.</i>

530
00:33:36,806 --> 00:33:38,558
<i>Make your decision as soon as possible.</i>

531
00:33:39,017 --> 00:33:41,144
<i>Before it's too late, Emilia.</i>

532
00:33:44,188 --> 00:33:47,608
Jaguar, I'll make this easy for you.

533
00:33:48,526 --> 00:33:50,737
<i>Leave the Ardientes alone.</i>

534
00:33:52,030 --> 00:33:56,242
Leave. Hide, and hide carefully.

535
00:33:56,826 --> 00:33:58,953
<i>Because when I put this phone down,</i>

536
00:33:59,829 --> 00:34:02,957
your death toll will start to ring.

537
00:34:03,833 --> 00:34:06,961
<i>I will be coming for you,</i>
<i>and I'll be bringing</i>

538
00:34:07,045 --> 00:34:08,921
the fires of hell with me.

539
00:34:09,005 --> 00:34:10,923
I promise you, Jaguar.

540
00:34:11,549 --> 00:34:13,926
I will put an end to your life.

541
00:34:26,689 --> 00:34:28,149
This is too much.

542
00:34:30,610 --> 00:34:32,236
I don't like this.

543
00:34:37,158 --> 00:34:38,242
Lily…

544
00:34:39,869 --> 00:34:41,704
It's time to stop pretending.

545
00:34:42,663 --> 00:34:45,166
You're just making everything
more complicated.

546
00:34:46,084 --> 00:34:48,753
I agreed to let you marry Arnaldo

547
00:34:49,629 --> 00:34:51,839
so that you could carry out your plans.

548
00:34:53,216 --> 00:34:54,884
Even though I hated the idea,

549
00:34:54,967 --> 00:34:57,261
I let you do it because I trust you.

550
00:34:58,554 --> 00:34:59,889
But this?

551
00:35:03,976 --> 00:35:07,563
If Emilia exposed you, then you
should've revealed yourself.

552
00:35:08,231 --> 00:35:10,024
We'll face this together.

553
00:35:10,817 --> 00:35:12,819
Our forces are stronger now.

554
00:35:13,653 --> 00:35:15,613
We can take them on.

555
00:35:16,447 --> 00:35:19,283
You don't need a fake Lily Cruz.

556
00:35:19,617 --> 00:35:23,704
[dramatic music playing]

557
00:35:27,250 --> 00:35:30,002
Stop dealing with Jaguar.

558
00:35:30,586 --> 00:35:32,255
You gained nothing from him.

559
00:35:32,672 --> 00:35:35,424
Instead of you making a fool out of him,

560
00:35:36,342 --> 00:35:39,846
it's been the other way around.

561
00:35:40,221 --> 00:35:42,765
It's so hard to tame him, Papa.

562
00:35:42,849 --> 00:35:46,310
-I need time!
-I don't have the time, Emilia.

563
00:35:47,895 --> 00:35:53,818
And I'm tired of you
sabotaging our family.

564
00:35:53,901 --> 00:35:55,570
From now on,

565
00:35:55,653 --> 00:35:59,991
I forbid you to act on your own.

566
00:36:01,367 --> 00:36:03,494
From now on,

567
00:36:03,578 --> 00:36:09,000
everything that you'll do
will come directly from me.

568
00:36:09,876 --> 00:36:12,670
You will follow me, just like before.

569
00:36:14,255 --> 00:36:18,676
Now let me lay down some rules
that have to be followed.

570
00:36:19,802 --> 00:36:24,182
First of all, stop pestering Ivy Aguas.

571
00:36:24,265 --> 00:36:31,063
Stop thwarting her wedding plans
with your son.

572
00:36:31,731 --> 00:36:33,065
And another thing.

573
00:36:33,649 --> 00:36:35,651
You will genuinely make peace with her.

574
00:36:36,444 --> 00:36:41,699
Kneel before her if necessary.
Kiss her feet if you have to!

575
00:36:41,782 --> 00:36:43,034
In short…

576
00:36:45,036 --> 00:36:48,748
You will do everything to please her.

577
00:36:48,831 --> 00:36:52,668
[gasps] I can't do that.
I'm not going to do that, Papa.

578
00:36:52,752 --> 00:36:55,504
She's the one marrying into our family.

579
00:36:55,588 --> 00:36:57,632
She's the one who's supposed
to be adjusting to me,

580
00:36:57,715 --> 00:36:59,550
not the other way around!

581
00:37:04,555 --> 00:37:06,224
With all due respect,

582
00:37:06,307 --> 00:37:09,477
Ivy had no idea about
what Jepoy and I did.

583
00:37:12,438 --> 00:37:15,149
It was our decision, because, like you,

584
00:37:15,233 --> 00:37:18,194
we also seek justice
for Aunt Carlotta's death.

585
00:37:18,277 --> 00:37:19,779
You knew Nanny Carlotta?

586
00:37:20,655 --> 00:37:21,781
I'm her niece.

587
00:37:22,782 --> 00:37:24,408
She was like a mother to me.

588
00:37:28,663 --> 00:37:29,789
Mom…

589
00:37:30,998 --> 00:37:34,126
Like you, I don't agree
with their plans either.

590
00:37:36,963 --> 00:37:38,589
But they kept on insisting.

591
00:37:39,215 --> 00:37:41,801
They said they have to do it
for Nanny Carlotta.

592
00:37:41,884 --> 00:37:45,054
That's why they want to fight
against the Ardientes.

593
00:37:49,100 --> 00:37:50,726
I'm just scared, Lily.

594
00:37:51,727 --> 00:37:53,604
So many people have been
dragged into this mess.

595
00:37:54,730 --> 00:37:57,108
At this point, the Ardientes
might soon find out

596
00:37:57,191 --> 00:37:58,943
who you really are and hurt you.

597
00:38:00,027 --> 00:38:02,697
Too much innocent blood has been shed.

598
00:38:04,323 --> 00:38:05,783
We came here prepared.

599
00:38:06,575 --> 00:38:08,536
Anna even studied everything.

600
00:38:13,666 --> 00:38:15,501
I know Lily Cruz in and out.

601
00:38:17,712 --> 00:38:20,506
I know everything
about her and her family.

602
00:38:22,091 --> 00:38:25,386
Everything the Ardientes put her through.

603
00:38:28,764 --> 00:38:29,890
Thank you.

604
00:38:31,767 --> 00:38:33,811
I know you just want to help.

605
00:38:36,689 --> 00:38:38,024
But this is too much.

606
00:38:40,318 --> 00:38:43,237
For a mother like me, it's hard to accept

607
00:38:43,321 --> 00:38:46,073
that someone is pretending
to be my daughter.

608
00:38:47,992 --> 00:38:49,452
Excuse me.

609
00:39:01,505 --> 00:39:06,552
Disobey my rules, Emilia,
and you will regret it

610
00:39:06,635 --> 00:39:08,262
for the rest of your life.

611
00:39:09,722 --> 00:39:12,350
-[sighs]
-But if you follow my orders,

612
00:39:13,392 --> 00:39:14,810
I promise you,

613
00:39:15,811 --> 00:39:19,273
you will be rewarded generously.

614
00:39:22,360 --> 00:39:24,987
[sighs] My dear daughter.

615
00:39:27,531 --> 00:39:30,201
Let's be close to each other once again.

616
00:39:32,828 --> 00:39:34,497
You need me.

617
00:39:36,207 --> 00:39:37,500
I need you.

618
00:39:39,335 --> 00:39:41,754
This family needs you.

619
00:39:44,048 --> 00:39:46,509
Okay, Papa. What do you want me to do?

620
00:39:56,936 --> 00:39:58,854
Lily Cruz.

621
00:39:59,855 --> 00:40:04,860
[ominous music playing]

622
00:40:10,324 --> 00:40:12,034
[Arnaldo] From now on,

623
00:40:12,118 --> 00:40:17,331
I don't want lazy and incompetent people

624
00:40:17,415 --> 00:40:18,582
in my campaign team.

625
00:40:19,875 --> 00:40:24,088
I need people who will do
everything to make me win.

626
00:40:25,881 --> 00:40:27,508
Now, if you're not that person…

627
00:40:29,176 --> 00:40:32,221
you can stand up and get out of my sight.

628
00:40:32,972 --> 00:40:37,935
[tense music playing]

629
00:40:42,815 --> 00:40:44,567
-You.
-Yes, me.

630
00:40:45,526 --> 00:40:47,236
You're going to lose this election.

631
00:40:48,279 --> 00:40:50,364
Isn't that right? Admit it.

632
00:40:50,865 --> 00:40:54,785
Stand up, and let's leave
this worthless politician.

633
00:40:56,162 --> 00:40:57,246
Are you done?

634
00:40:58,330 --> 00:40:59,582
I'm leaving.

635
00:41:00,749 --> 00:41:02,460
Wait! Just a second.

636
00:41:02,877 --> 00:41:05,045
You're leaving without your paycheck?

637
00:41:08,507 --> 00:41:09,884
[sighs] Hold on.

638
00:41:11,010 --> 00:41:14,388
-[smacks]
-[groaning]

639
00:41:14,472 --> 00:41:15,848
[coughing]

640
00:41:15,931 --> 00:41:17,933
-[smacks]
-[groaning]

641
00:41:19,518 --> 00:41:20,978
-[coughs]
-[Arnaldo] So…

642
00:41:21,479 --> 00:41:27,026
Who else is going to stand up and leave?

643
00:41:27,818 --> 00:41:28,944
Anyone?

644
00:41:30,738 --> 00:41:31,947
Answer me!

645
00:41:34,950 --> 00:41:36,619
Well then, let's begin.

646
00:41:36,702 --> 00:41:40,706
[unsettling music playing]

647
00:41:45,127 --> 00:41:46,295
Mom…

648
00:41:50,966 --> 00:41:52,801
I tried to talk to them.

649
00:41:53,260 --> 00:41:58,599
I told them I was against their plans.

650
00:42:00,142 --> 00:42:01,310
So…

651
00:42:04,271 --> 00:42:05,272
Mom.

652
00:42:08,192 --> 00:42:10,194
[sobbing]

653
00:42:12,321 --> 00:42:13,822
Please don't cry.

654
00:42:15,950 --> 00:42:18,035
I promise you that Anna and Jepoy

655
00:42:18,118 --> 00:42:19,745
won't be here for long.

656
00:42:20,704 --> 00:42:24,041
I just have to regain
the trust of the Ardientes.

657
00:42:25,125 --> 00:42:27,586
I can't reveal who I am just yet

658
00:42:27,670 --> 00:42:30,464
because I have to push through
with my wedding to Arnaldo.

659
00:42:32,091 --> 00:42:33,801
Mom, I know this is hard for you.

660
00:42:35,052 --> 00:42:37,555
Please stop crying, Mom.

661
00:42:38,055 --> 00:42:39,932
I know it's difficult,

662
00:42:40,849 --> 00:42:43,185
but you have to trust me.

663
00:42:45,229 --> 00:42:47,398
Lily, how can I trust you?

664
00:42:48,732 --> 00:42:50,985
You keep secrets from me.

665
00:42:57,950 --> 00:43:00,578
Mom, I hate having
to keep secrets from you.

666
00:43:02,454 --> 00:43:06,584
But I have to prioritize
your safety above all.

667
00:43:06,667 --> 00:43:08,002
What about yours?

668
00:43:09,378 --> 00:43:11,505
Are you safe with the things you're doing?

669
00:43:13,090 --> 00:43:16,260
I can't let something bad happen to you.

670
00:43:18,470 --> 00:43:19,763
You managed to convince Ivy?

671
00:43:24,101 --> 00:43:25,060
Diego.

672
00:43:26,353 --> 00:43:28,772
Thank you for watching over Ivy
when I wasn't around.

673
00:43:31,400 --> 00:43:35,321
Jepoy, as long as I'm alive,
I'll keep protecting her.

674
00:43:35,404 --> 00:43:37,781
[tense music playing]

675
00:43:39,617 --> 00:43:41,952
Are Ivy and her mom going to be okay?

676
00:43:42,494 --> 00:43:44,455
They're fighting because of me.

677
00:43:44,538 --> 00:43:45,789
No, it was my fault.

678
00:43:48,626 --> 00:43:49,752
Don't worry.

679
00:43:50,210 --> 00:43:51,629
They just have to talk it over.

680
00:43:51,712 --> 00:43:55,633
You're Diego, aren't you?
Lily's childhood best friend.

681
00:43:58,761 --> 00:44:02,681
If you need to know more
about our childhood,

682
00:44:03,307 --> 00:44:04,683
just ask me about it.

683
00:44:05,142 --> 00:44:07,102
If you're pretending to be Lily Cruz,

684
00:44:07,936 --> 00:44:10,189
you need to learn everything about her.

685
00:44:12,775 --> 00:44:13,942
[Jepoy] Hold on.

686
00:44:15,569 --> 00:44:19,114
You don't want Ivy to
marry Arnaldo either, right?

687
00:44:21,533 --> 00:44:23,202
You already know my answer to that.

688
00:44:23,577 --> 00:44:28,624
[tense music playing]

689
00:44:33,754 --> 00:44:35,255
<i>This is a peace agreement.</i>

690
00:44:35,339 --> 00:44:39,301
<i>From this day on, the killing, cheating,</i>

691
00:44:39,385 --> 00:44:42,137
<i>and blackmailing between Diego Torillo</i>

692
00:44:42,221 --> 00:44:44,181
<i>and Arnaldo Ardiente-Torillo will stop.</i>

693
00:44:44,264 --> 00:44:46,892
[Arnaldo] <i>For a peaceful election.</i>

694
00:44:46,975 --> 00:44:50,979
[cheering]

695
00:44:51,063 --> 00:44:53,190
<i>Ladies and gentlemen, Lily Cruz!</i>

696
00:44:53,273 --> 00:44:55,275
[reporter] <i>Do you also</i>
<i>plan to file a lawsuit</i>

697
00:44:55,359 --> 00:44:57,444
<i>against the Ardientes</i>
<i>like your mother did?</i>

698
00:44:58,153 --> 00:45:02,616
[Emilia] <i>I want you to witness</i>
<i>Lily Cruz being buried alive.</i>

699
00:45:02,699 --> 00:45:04,535
<i>It's just one phone call away.</i>

700
00:45:06,286 --> 00:45:09,706
[theme music playing]
